":525,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0536","start":536,"end":538,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0541","start":541,"end":543,"surface":"張武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m002-0560","start":560,"end":562,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p004","text":"群臣以禮次侍。乃使太仆嬰與東牟侯興居清宮，奉天子法駕，迎于代邸。皇帝即日夕入未央宮。乃夜拜宋昌為衛將軍，鎮撫南北軍。以張武為郎中令，行殿中。還坐前殿。於是夜下詔書曰：「閒者諸呂用事擅權，謀為大逆，欲以危劉氏宗廟，賴將相列侯宗室大臣誅之，皆伏其辜。朕初即位，其赦天下，賜民爵一級，女子百戶牛酒，酺五日。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"太仆嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"l8e_aho_h3v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"興居","kind":"person","person_id":"pdj_awg_50i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"張武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p027","text":"十四年冬，匈奴謀入邊為寇，攻朝那塞，殺北地都尉卬。上乃遣三將軍軍隴西、北地、上郡，中尉周舍為衛將軍，郎中令張武為車騎將軍，軍渭北，車千乘，騎卒十萬。帝親自勞軍，勒兵申教令，賜軍吏卒。帝欲自將擊匈奴，群臣諫，皆不聽。皇太后固要帝，帝乃止。於是以東陽侯張相如為大將軍，成侯赤為內史，欒布為將軍，擊匈奴。匈奴遁走。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0019","start":19,"end":24,"surface":"北地都尉卬","kind":"person","person_id":"zn2_vwj_e9n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"周舍","kind":"person","person_id":"3u2_btf_ob4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"張武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0091","start":91,"end":92,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0107","start":107,"end":110,"surface":"皇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"a82_krd_hlg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0114","start":114,"end":115,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0124","start":124,"end":127,"surface":"張相如","kind":"person","person_id":"l7w_xfi_scd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0132","start":132,"end":135,"surface":"成侯赤","kind":"person","person_id":"r7t_6ys_2oo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m027-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"欒布","kind":"person","person_id":"so1_ycw_xkv","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p034","text":"後六年冬，匈奴三萬人入上郡，三萬人入雲中。以中大夫令勉為車騎將軍，軍飛狐；故楚相蘇意為將軍，軍句注；將軍張武屯北地；河內守周亞夫為將軍，居細柳；宗正劉禮為將軍，居霸上；祝茲侯軍棘門：以備胡。數月，胡人去，亦罷。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m034-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"令勉","kind":"person","person_id":"84x_1ix_p37","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m034-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"蘇意","kind":"person","person_id":"kfu_u3t_85t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m034-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"張武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m034-0061","start":61,"end":64,"surface":"周亞夫","kind":"person","person_id":"nwx_f88_xfu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m034-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"劉禮","kind":"person","person_id":"1xg_tyg_l9z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m034-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"祝茲侯","kind":"person","person_id":"p7v_ue3_b2p","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p036","text":"孝文帝從代來，即位二十三年，宮室苑囿狗馬服御無所增益，有不便，輒弛以利民。嘗欲作露臺，召匠計之，直百金。上曰：「百金中民十家之產，吾奉先帝宮室，常恐羞之，何以臺為！」上常衣綈衣，所幸慎夫人，令衣不得曳地，幃帳不得文繡，以示敦樸，為天下先。治霸陵皆以瓦器，不得以金銀銅錫為飾，不治墳，欲為省，毋煩民。南越王尉佗自立為武帝，然上召貴尉佗兄弟，以德報之，佗遂去帝稱臣。與匈奴和親，匈奴背約入盜，然令邊備守，不發兵深入，惡煩苦百姓。吳王詐病不朝，就賜幾杖。群臣如袁盎等稱說雖切，常假借用之。群臣如張武等受賂遺金錢，覺，上乃發御府金錢賜之，以愧其心，弗下吏。專務以德化民，是以海內殷富，興於禮義。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"慎夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"h9h_k94_pst","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"尉佗","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0161","start":161,"end":162,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"尉佗","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0174","start":174,"end":175,"surface":"佗","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0212","start":212,"end":214,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"tpx_x74_xhk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"ibu_a0b_ggu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0244","start":244,"end":246,"surface":"張武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m036-0255","start":255,"end":256,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p037","text":"後七年六月己亥，帝崩於未央宮。遺詔曰：「朕聞蓋天下萬物之萌生，靡不有死。死者天地之理，物之自然者，奚可甚哀。當今之時，世咸嘉生而惡死，厚葬以破業，重服以傷生，吾甚不取。且朕既不德，無以佐百姓；今崩，又使重服久臨，以離寒暑之數，哀人之父子，傷長幼之志，損其飲食，絕鬼神之祭祀，以重吾不德也，謂天下何！朕獲保宗廟，以眇眇之身讬于天下君王之上，二十有餘年矣。賴天地之靈，社稷之福，方內安寧，靡有兵革。朕既不敏，常畏過行，以羞先帝之遺德；維年之久長，懼于不終。今乃幸以天年，得復供養于高廟。朕之不明與嘉之，其奚哀悲之有！其令天下吏民，令到出臨三日，皆釋服。毋禁取婦嫁女祠祀飲酒食肉者。自當給喪事服臨者，皆無踐。絰帶無過三寸，毋布車及兵器，毋發民男女哭臨宮殿。宮殿中當臨者，皆以旦夕各十五舉聲，禮畢罷。非旦夕臨時，禁毋得擅哭。已下，服大紅十五日，小紅十四日，纖七日，釋服。佗不在令中者，皆以此令比率從事。布告天下，使明知朕意。霸陵山川因其故，毋有所改。歸夫人以下至少使。」令中尉亞夫為車騎將軍，屬國悍為將屯將軍，郎中令武為復土將軍，發近縣見卒萬六千人，發內史卒萬五千人，藏郭穿復土屬將軍武。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m037-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m037-0209","start":209,"end":211,"surface":"先帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或神祇指稱未定；不補未見姓名或血親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m037-0381","start":381,"end":386,"surface":"佗不在令中","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或神祇指稱未定；不補未見姓名或血親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m037-0422","start":422,"end":429,"surface":"夫人以下至少使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或神祇指稱未定；不補未見姓名或血親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m037-0434","start":434,"end":436,"surface":"亞夫","kind":"person","person_id":"nwx_f88_xfu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m037-0442","start":442,"end":445,"surface":"屬國悍","kind":"person","person_id":"yre_3um_pha","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m037-0451","start":451,"end":455,"surface":"郎中令武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m037-0486","start":486,"end":489,"surface":"將軍武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-010","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi","source":{"title":"史記／卷010","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷010","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷010&oldid=2599229","revision_id":2599229,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"正文41個p區塊，自孝文皇帝至太史公論贊；排除前置跨站dd及末尾索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；